  "title": "RTX's Collins Aerospace accelerates production with $26.5 million investment in Largo, Florida",
  "summary": "LARGO, Fla., May 11, 2026 /PRNewswire/ --Collins Aerospace, an RTX (NYSE: RTX) business, is investing $26.5 million to expand its Largo, Florida facility to accelerate the production of its commercial aviation radars and multi-domain security solutions for defense customers. This investment will create over 100 new highly skilled jobs across engineering and factory operations disciplines.",
